 to melt your  chocolate on high in the microwave  because that will cause your chocolate  to seize so it won't really get that  super smooth like ribbony effect you  want to melt your chocolate probably on  medium power and stir every 30 seconds  this will ensure that your chocolate  doesn't seize and get that super clumpy  not so attractive texture you want that  smooth ribbony like oh my gosh I  literally just want to pour this in my  mouth texture I never thought in a  million years I'd be filling up a muffin  tin with water to create ice cubes to  dip in melted chocolate to create  something that could be sold in like a  high-end chocolate shop in Beverly Hills  you know
 

